      {"field": "wf", "action": "set_then_callback"}
    ],
    "relation_tolerance": "1e-9",
    "evidence_note": "Observed in the maintained PLL 28 nm to 65 nm migration flow. Revalidate field presence, meanings, and callback order against each live target master/PDK revision before writes."
